.TH DML 1 "October 2026" "dml 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dml \- inspect local DaggerML repository state
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dml
.RB [ \--help | \--version | \-V ]
.br
.B dml
.RB [ \--json ]
.BI \--repo " PATH"
.I COMMAND
.RB [ ARGS ... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The native inspection CLI resolves refs, shows typed objects, looks up DAG bindings,
walks nested DAG structure, displays snapshots and traverses all-parent commit history.
It does not initialize or mutate repositories.
